      "translation": "Once upon a time, there was a magic mountain. One day each year, you could make one wish come true!",
      "translations": [
        "Once upon a time, there was a magic mountain. One day each year, you could make one wish come true!",
        "One day, a rich, greedy man said, “I want jewels! Lots and lots of jewels!” A young hero heard him and thought, “Oh no! The jewels could roll down and hit our homes!”",
        "What could he do? The hero thought and thought. Build a wall? Big jewels could knock it down! Make a funnel? That would take too long!",
        "“I’ve got it!” The hero ran up the mountain and made his wish first. “Please don’t let the jewels fall. Keep everyone safe!”",
        "Not a single jewel fell. The hero smiled. “Keeping everyone safe is worth more than all the jewels!”"
      ],
